# Lab server SSH daemon configuration (demo data, deliberately not fully hardened)
Port 22
Protocol 2
PermitRootLogin yes
PasswordAuthentication no
PermitEmptyPasswords no
MaxAuthTries 3
X11Forwarding no
LoginGraceTime 60
Banner /etc/issue.net
ClientAliveInterval 300
ClientAliveCountMax 3
UsePAM yes
Include /etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/*.conf
